# Capacitor uses the system WebView. Many devices (e.g. Huawei) ship or freeze on
# Chromium < 90 until "Android System WebView" is updated. Targeting only >= 90
# can emit JS the WebView cannot parse → blank/black screen with no obvious crash.
Chrome >= 75
ChromeAndroid >= 75
Firefox >= 75
Edge >= 75
Safari >= 15
iOS >= 15
